WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:01.600
Your son comes

00:01.680 --> 00:03.840
To plead for Yu Gong, Chancellor of the Imperial Academy

00:03.920 --> 00:04.880
To beg for mercy

00:04.960 --> 00:06.240
Good

00:06.320 --> 00:08.160
It seems you already know

00:13.160 --> 00:14.560
Tell me

00:14.840 --> 00:16.640
Why plead for him?

